ldren menu-item-5558\"><a href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2Findex.html&amp;anchor=0\">후원하기</a>\n<ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n\t<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-3447\"><a href=\"#/page?file=donation%2Findex.html\">후원 방법</a></li>\n\t<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-3117\"><a href=\"#/page?file=partner%2Findex.html\">협력상담사</a></li>\n\t<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-4499\"><a href=\"#/page?file=%ED%98%91%EB%A0%A5%EB%8B%A8%EC%B2%B4%2Findex.html\">협력단체</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-3112\"><a href=\"#/page?file=faq%2Findex.html\">자주 묻는 질문</a></li>\n<li class=\"lang-item lang-item-72 lang-item-en no-translation lang-item-first menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-5635-en\"><a href=\"#/page?file=en%2Findex.html\" hreflang=\"en-CA\" lang=\"en-CA\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"English\" width=\"16\" height=\"11\" style=\"width: 16px; height: 11px;\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></li>\n</ul>\t\t\t\t</nav>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>  </header>\n<!-- = Page banner area start = \\-->\n<section class=\"grop-banner-area grop-page_banner_height-200 \" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;./archive/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/3_banner_lawbooks.jpg&quot;); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: center center; background-size: cover; background-attachment: ;\">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"grop-full_height  container\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"grop-vertical_middle  text-uppercase  grop-page_title\">캐나다 법률정보 책자</h2>\n\t</div>\n\t<!--banner overly start\\-->\n\t<div class=\"grop-page_banr_overly_opc-30\"></div><!--/banner overly end-->\n</section>\n<div class=\"grop-project_grid_area\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"grop-filter_content_warp grop-prjt-page\">\n      <!-- Project Filter -->\n              <div id=\"grop_filters\" class=\"text-left grop-projctfilter_nav\">\n          <ul class=\"text-uppercase list-inline\">\n      \t\t\t<li class=\"grop-filte_btn is-active\" data-filter=\"*\">Show All</li>\n            <li class=\"grop-filte_btn cat-category-2\" data-filter=\".category-2\" title=\"가정법\">가정법</li><li class=\"grop-filte_btn cat-category-3\" data-filter=\".category-3\" title=\"고용과 근로\">고용과 근로</li><li class=\"grop-filte_btn cat-category-4\" data-filter=\".category-4\" title=\"사회보장과 복지\">사회보장과 복지</li><li class=\"grop-filte_btn cat-category-8\" data-filter=\".category-8\" title=\"유언장과 위임장\">유언장과 위임장</li><li class=\"grop-filte_btn cat-category-5\" data-filter=\".category-5\" title=\"이민법\">이민법</li><li class=\"grop-filte_btn cat-category-1\" data-filter=\".category-1\" title=\"주택임대차법\">주택임대차법</li><li class=\"grop-filte_btn cat-category-7\" data-filter=\".category-7\" title=\"학대와 가정폭력\">학대와 가정폭력</li><li class=\"grop-filte_btn cat-category-6\" data-filter=\".category-6\" title=\"형법\">형법</li>      \t\t</ul>\n        </div>\n      \n      <!-- Project Start -->\n      <div class=\"grop-filter_content  grop-projctfilter_content\" data-restored-grid=\"\">\n\n                <div class=\"grop-filter_single_col  grop-projctfilter_col bpw-col-2 category-3 \">\n          <div class=\"grop-projct_itm_warp\">\n            <!--project Media box start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_media_box\">\n              <a class=\"grop-cause_media_img\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2Fbook_employment_1makeclaim%2Findex.html\">\n                <img src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/book_employment_1makeClaim-360x234.jpg\" alt=\"근로자 재해보상 청구\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </a>\n\n            </div><!--/end-->\n\n            <!--project content text start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_content_warp\">\n              <h4>\n                <a href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2Fbook_employment_1makeclaim%2Findex.html\">근로자 재해보상 청구</a>\n              </h4>\n              <p>이 자료는 직업 관련 상해 또는 질병이 있는 경우 근로자가해야 할 일, 직장 안전 및 보험 이사회의 혜택을 신청할 수있는 방법, 그리고 이사회가 상해 보고서를 받으면 어떻게 되는지 설명합니다. 또한 고용주가 해야 할 일과 부상당한 근로자가 법적 도움을 받을 수 있는 부분에 대한 내용이 있습니다.\n</p><div class=\"project-link\">\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-en\" href=\"https://www.cleo.on.ca/en/publications/makeclaim\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<span>원문보기</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-down\" href=\"./archive/download/3351/document.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" type=\"application/pdf\" data-document=\"pdf\">\n<span>다운받기</span>\n</a>\n</div><p></p>\n              <!--  project btn start  \\-->\n              <a class=\"grop-btn grop-btn_overly grop-vpjct_btn\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2Fbook_employment_1makeclaim%2Findex.html\">\n                <span>View Project</span>\n              </a><!--/end-->\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n                <div class=\"grop-filter_single_col  grop-projctfilter_col bpw-col-2 category-5 \">\n          <div class=\"grop-projct_itm_warp\">\n            <!--project Media box start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_media_box\">\n              <a class=\"grop-cause_media_img\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EC%A0%95%EC%8B%A0%EC%A7%88%ED%99%98-%ED%98%95%EC%82%AC%EB%B2%94%EC%A3%84-%EB%B0%8F-%EA%B5%AD%EC%99%B8%EC%B6%94%EB%B0%A9%2Findex.html\">\n                <img src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/book_immigration_1mentIll-360x234.jpg\" alt=\"정신질환, 형사범죄 및 국외추방\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </a>\n\n            </div><!--/end-->\n\n            <!--project content text start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_content_warp\">\n              <h4>\n                <a href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EC%A0%95%EC%8B%A0%EC%A7%88%ED%99%98-%ED%98%95%EC%82%AC%EB%B2%94%EC%A3%84-%EB%B0%8F-%EA%B5%AD%EC%99%B8%EC%B6%94%EB%B0%A9%2Findex.html\">정신질환, 형사범죄 및 국외추방</a>\n              </h4>\n              <p>정신 질환을 앓고있는 사람들은 불균형한 숫자로 법에 저촉됩니다. 캐나다 시민이 아닌 경우 캐나다 시민권을 박탈 당할 수 있습니다. 이 간행물은 형사 사법제도에 의해, 정신 질환자가 박탈 위험에 처할 수 있는 일선 근로자를위한 자료입니다.\n</p><div class=\"project-link\">\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-en\" href=\"https://www.cleo.on.ca/en/publications/mentill\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<span>원문보기</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-down\" href=\"./archive/download/3407/document.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" type=\"application/pdf\" data-document=\"pdf\">\n<span>다운받기</span>\n</a>\n</div><p></p>\n              <!--  project btn start  \\-->\n              <a class=\"grop-btn grop-btn_overly grop-vpjct_btn\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EC%A0%95%EC%8B%A0%EC%A7%88%ED%99%98-%ED%98%95%EC%82%AC%EB%B2%94%EC%A3%84-%EB%B0%8F-%EA%B5%AD%EC%99%B8%EC%B6%94%EB%B0%A9%2Findex.html\">\n                <span>View Project</span>\n              </a><!--/end-->\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n                <div class=\"grop-filter_single_col  grop-projctfilter_col bpw-col-2 category-1 \">\n          <div class=\"grop-projct_itm_warp\">\n            <!--project Media box start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_media_box\">\n              <a class=\"grop-cause_media_img\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EC%9C%A0%EC%A7%80-%EB%B3%B4%EC%88%98-%EB%B0%8F-%EC%88%98%EB%A6%AC%2Findex.html\">\n                <img src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/book_housing_4mainReps-360x234.jpg\" alt=\"유지 보수 및 수리\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </a>\n\n            </div><!--/end-->\n\n            <!--project content text start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_content_warp\">\n              <h4>\n                <a href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EC%9C%A0%EC%A7%80-%EB%B3%B4%EC%88%98-%EB%B0%8F-%EC%88%98%EB%A6%AC%2Findex.html\">유지 보수 및 수리</a>\n              </h4>\n              <p>모든 세입자는 청결하고 안전한 건물에서 잘 유지되는 집에 대한 권리를 가집니다. 이 자료는 집주인이 해야하는 유지 보수 및 수리 유형을 설명하고, 세입자가 물건을 고치기위해 취할 수있는 단계 및 세입자가 도움을받을 수있는 방법을 설명합니다.\n</p><div class=\"project-link\">\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-en\" href=\"https://www.cleo.on.ca/en/publications/mainreps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<span>원문보기</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-down\" href=\"./archive/download/3386/document.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" type=\"application/pdf\" data-document=\"pdf\">\n<span>다운받기</span>\n</a>\n</div><p></p>\n              <!--  project btn start  \\-->\n              <a class=\"grop-btn grop-btn_overly grop-vpjct_btn\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EC%9C%A0%EC%A7%80-%EB%B3%B4%EC%88%98-%EB%B0%8F-%EC%88%98%EB%A6%AC%2Findex.html\">\n                <span>View Project</span>\n              </a><!--/end-->\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n                <div class=\"grop-filter_single_col  grop-projctfilter_col bpw-col-2 category-1 \">\n          <div class=\"grop-projct_itm_warp\">\n            <!--project Media box start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_media_box\">\n              <a class=\"grop-cause_media_img\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EA%B4%B4%EB%A1%AD%ED%9E%98-%EB%B0%8F-%EC%B0%A8%EB%B3%84%2Findex.html\">\n                <img src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/book_housing_2harassE-360x234.jpg\" alt=\"괴롭힘 및 차별\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </a>\n\n            </div><!--/end-->\n\n            <!--project content text start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_content_warp\">\n              <h4>\n                <a href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EA%B4%B4%EB%A1%AD%ED%9E%98-%EB%B0%8F-%EC%B0%A8%EB%B3%84%2Findex.html\">괴롭힘 및 차별</a>\n              </h4>\n              <p>세입자는 프라이버시에 대한 법적 권리와 집주인이나 다른 세입자의 괴롭힘과 차별을 당하지 않을 권리가 있습니다.\n</p><div class=\"project-link\">\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-en\" href=\"https://www.cleo.on.ca/en/publications/harass-e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<span>원문보기</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-down\" href=\"./archive/download/3348/document.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" type=\"application/pdf\" data-document=\"pdf\">\n<span>다운받기</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n<p></p>\n              <!--  project btn start  \\-->\n              <a class=\"grop-btn grop-btn_overly grop-vpjct_btn\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EA%B4%B4%EB%A1%AD%ED%9E%98-%EB%B0%8F-%EC%B0%A8%EB%B3%84%2Findex.html\">\n                <span>View Project</span>\n              </a><!--/end-->\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n                <div class=\"grop-filter_single_col  grop-projctfilter_col bpw-col-2 category-1 \">\n          <div class=\"grop-projct_itm_warp\">\n            <!--project Media box start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_media_box\">\n              <a class=\"grop-cause_media_img\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EC%9D%B4%EC%82%AC-%EB%82%98%EA%B0%80%EA%B8%B0%2Findex.html\">\n                <img src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/book_housing_5moving-360x234.jpg\" alt=\"이사 나가기\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </a>\n\n            </div><!--/end-->\n\n            <!--project content text start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_content_warp\">\n              <h4>\n                <a href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EC%9D%B4%EC%82%AC-%EB%82%98%EA%B0%80%EA%B8%B0%2Findex.html\">이사 나가기</a>\n              </h4>\n              <p>이 자료는 이사하는 경우 세입자가 해야 할 일과 규칙을 준수하지 않을 경우 발생할 수있는 상황을 설명합니다. 일찍 퇴거하는 방법을 다루는 섹션이 있습니다. 집주인과 계약을 맺고, 집주인을 임명하고, 집주인과 세입자위원회에 신청하는 방법입니다.\n</p><div class=\"project-link\">\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-en\" href=\"https://www.cleo.on.ca/en/publications/moving-notice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<span>원문보기</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-down\" href=\"./archive/download/3392/document.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" type=\"application/pdf\" data-document=\"pdf\">\n<span>다운받기</span>\n</a>\n</div><p></p>\n              <!--  project btn start  \\-->\n              <a class=\"grop-btn grop-btn_overly grop-vpjct_btn\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EC%9D%B4%EC%82%AC-%EB%82%98%EA%B0%80%EA%B8%B0%2Findex.html\">\n                <span>View Project</span>\n              </a><!--/end-->\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n                <div class=\"grop-filter_single_col  grop-projctfilter_col bpw-col-2 category-1 \">\n          <div class=\"grop-projct_itm_warp\">\n            <!--project Media box start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_media_box\">\n              <a class=\"grop-cause_media_img\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EA%B0%84%EB%B3%91%EC%8B%9C%EC%84%A4%2Findex.html\">\n                <img src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/book_housing_1careHome-360x234.jpg\" alt=\"간병시설\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </a>\n\n            </div><!--/end-->\n\n            <!--project content text start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_content_warp\">\n              <h4>\n                <a href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EA%B0%84%EB%B3%91%EC%8B%9C%EC%84%A4%2Findex.html\">간병시설</a>\n              </h4>\n              <p>간호 주택은 건강 관리 서비스, 간병 서비스 또는 일상 생활에 도움이 되는 임대 주택입니다. 이 간행물은 누군가가 간병인 임차인인지 알아보고 간병인의 권리를 설명합니다. 정보 패키지, 임차 계약, 임대료, 서비스 및 퇴거 등과 같은 주제를 다룹니다.\n</p><div class=\"project-link\">\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-en\" href=\"https://www.cleo.on.ca/en/publications/carehome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<span>원문보기</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-down\" href=\"./archive/download/3325/document.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" type=\"application/pdf\" data-document=\"pdf\">\n<span>다운받기</span>\n</a>\n</div><p></p>\n              <!--  project btn start  \\-->\n              <a class=\"grop-btn grop-btn_overly grop-vpjct_btn\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EA%B0%84%EB%B3%91%EC%8B%9C%EC%84%A4%2Findex.html\">\n                <span>View Project</span>\n              </a><!--/end-->\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n                <div class=\"grop-filter_single_col  grop-projctfilter_col bpw-col-2 category-6 \">\n          <div class=\"grop-projct_itm_warp\">\n            <!--project Media box start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_media_box\">\n              <a class=\"grop-cause_media_img\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EA%B2%BD%EC%B0%B0%EA%B6%8C-%EB%B6%88%EC%8B%AC-%EA%B2%80%EB%AC%B8%2Findex.html\">\n                <img src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/book_criminallaw_1polPower-360x234.jpg\" alt=\"경찰권: 불심 검문\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </a>\n\n            </div><!--/end-->\n\n            <!--project content text start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_content_warp\">\n              <h4>\n                <a href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EA%B2%BD%EC%B0%B0%EA%B6%8C-%EB%B6%88%EC%8B%AC-%EA%B2%80%EB%AC%B8%2Findex.html\">경찰권: 불심 검문</a>\n              </h4>\n              <p>이 자료는 경찰에 의해 중지, 심문, 수색, 체포 또는 억류 된 사람의 권리를 명시합니다. 경찰이 언제 누군가의 집에 들어가거나 검색 할 수 있는지도 설명합니다.\n</p><div class=\"project-link\">\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-en\" href=\"https://www.cleo.on.ca/en/publications/polpower\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<span>원문보기</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-down\" href=\"./archive/download/3339/document.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" type=\"application/pdf\" data-document=\"pdf\">\n<span>다운받기</span>\n</a>\n</div><p></p>\n              <!--  project btn start  \\-->\n              <a class=\"grop-btn grop-btn_overly grop-vpjct_btn\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EA%B2%BD%EC%B0%B0%EA%B6%8C-%EB%B6%88%EC%8B%AC-%EA%B2%80%EB%AC%B8%2Findex.html\">\n                <span>View Project</span>\n              </a><!--/end-->\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n                <div class=\"grop-filter_single_col  grop-projctfilter_col bpw-col-2 category-1 \">\n          <div class=\"grop-projct_itm_warp\">\n            <!--project Media box start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_media_box\">\n              <a class=\"grop-cause_media_img\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EC%9E%84%EB%8C%80%EB%A3%8C-%EC%9D%B8%EC%83%81%2Findex.html\">\n                <img src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/book_housing_6rentIncs-360x234.jpg\" alt=\"임대료 인상\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </a>\n\n            </div><!--/end-->\n\n            <!--project content text start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_content_warp\">\n              <h4>\n                <a href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EC%9E%84%EB%8C%80%EB%A3%8C-%EC%9D%B8%EC%83%81%2Findex.html\">임대료 인상</a>\n              </h4>\n              <p>세입자의 집세를 늘리려면 집주인은 주거용 주택법에 의해 정해진 규칙을 따라야합니다. 이 자료는 이러한 규칙을 설명합니다. 또한 집주인과 세입자가 임대료를 높이기 위해 할증료 및 기타 요금에 관한 규칙을 세울 수 있고, 세입자가 불법 임대료를 청구 할 경우 취할 수있는 조치에 대해 설명합니다.\n</p><div class=\"project-link\">\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-en\" href=\"https://www.cleo.on.ca/en/publications/rentincs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<span>원문보기</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-down\" href=\"./archive/download/3399/document.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" type=\"application/pdf\" data-document=\"pdf\">\n<span>다운받기</span>\n</a>\n</div><p></p>\n              <!--  project btn start  \\-->\n              <a class=\"grop-btn grop-btn_overly grop-vpjct_btn\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EC%9E%84%EB%8C%80%EB%A3%8C-%EC%9D%B8%EC%83%81%2Findex.html\">\n                <span>View Project</span>\n              </a><!--/end-->\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n      </div>\n      <!-- Project End -->\n\n        <div class=\"text-center grop-posts-pagination-warp\">\n    <nav class=\"navigation pagination\">\n      <div class=\"nav-links\">\n      <span aria-current=\"page\" class=\"page-numbers current\">1</span>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" href=\"#/page?file=_offline%2Ffetched%2F7ae8a3e29f17.html\">2</a>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" href=\"#/page?file=_o